<p style="text-align: center;"><img src="/images/2014/Cassidy.jpg" alt="A portrait of a polled ram with abstract partially unfinished gray background" width="450" height="567" /></p>
<p style="text-align: center;">Weatherlea Ram. 14x11, oil on linen panel. 2014</p>
<p style="text-align: left;">I started this painting as a demo for workshop I held over the weekend. Unfortunately I talked for way too long and only had time to do the block in so I had to do most of the painting work today.</p>
<p style="text-align: left;">The focus of the workshop was on the creative process for animal paintings, so much of the class time was spent on value sketches and color studies, both of which I did as part of the painting process.</p>